              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "82246168-00bb-41ec-b603-f5928268a512"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "They have begun to catch these patterns and implement coping strategies such as asking about priorities, communicating with their partner Nora about having a hard day, and leaving work on time occasionally."
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "e4c55605-a652-47b6-a938-1233ee23b376"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "These interventions have reduced feelings of being trapped, though they do not provide immediate relief.\n"
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "4cce5283-d5c1-4ec2-bbfa-80422bae65a6"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "0e1552ee-1432-4d1f-ad87-63fbe5ae421c"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "The patient reports a recent difficult period during a deadline week, which they managed by asking for help and communicating with Nora."
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "1230924a-5500-435a-8bcf-a235bda92f6e"
              },
              {
