              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "01244d79-b131-46ed-b472-0d7d8e5678f0"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "They used their support plan during this time and feel less ashamed about doing so."
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "db9c3582-1767-45d8-a18c-ae496d249f19"
              },
              {
