              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "276fb57d-4b4b-4afd-a003-cd1d4df886e7"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "Since the deadline week, the patient has not experienced thoughts of self-harm but continues to have anxious nights."
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "d6dbc402-b394-44fd-a61e-ea23a900ea12"
              },
