              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "They recognize a tendency to say yes to every extra request and have identified the need to ask for priorities early, maintain adequate food and sleep, and communicate with Nora when struggling."
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "f5d4e3af-57ea-4651-be9a-4c3c42865045"
